# PROJECT CHIMERA RULES

## Context
This is Project Chimera: Autonomous Influencer Network using:
1. Model Context Protocol (MCP) for ALL external calls
2. FastRender Swarm (Planner-Worker-Judge pattern)
3. Coinbase AgentKit for Agentic Commerce
4. Weaviate + Redis + PostgreSQL for data

## Prime Directives
1. ALWAYS check specs/ before writing ANY code
2. NO direct API calls - ONLY MCP Tools/Resources
3. Follow Planner→Worker→Judge workflow strictly
4. Financial transactions MUST pass CFO Judge
5. Write failing tests first (TDD approach)

## Code Standards
- Use Pydantic v2 for ALL data models
- Async/await for ALL I/O operations
- Type hints REQUIRED for all functions
- MCP calls wrapped in try/except with retry logic
- All secrets via environment variables (never hardcoded)

## Traceability Requirement
When implementing any feature:
1. Reference the SRS Functional Requirement (FR X.X)
2. Reference the spec file and section
3. Explain your plan BEFORE writing code
4. Update specs/ if requirements evolve

## MCP Rules
- **Tools**: Executable functions (generate_image, send_transaction)
- **Resources**: Data sources (news://, twitter://)
- **Prompts**: Reusable templates (analyze_sentiment)
- All external connectivity via MCP Servers
